{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29228","headline":"送从兄别驾归蜀 · 许浑","name":"送从兄别驾归蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻与湘南令，童年侍玉墀。\n家留秦塞曲，官谪瘴溪湄。\n道直奸臣屏，冤深圣主知。\n逝川东去疾，霈泽北来迟。\n青汉龙髯绝，苍岑马鬣移。\n风凄闻笛处，月惨罢琴时。\n客路黄公庙，乡关白帝祠。\n已称鹦鹉赋，宁诵鶺鴒诗。\n远道书难达，长亭酒莫持。\n当凭蜀江水，万里寄相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}